                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "One of if not my favorite stand alone VR story game of all time. I have gotten it for so many other people to watch them play it. the Story is amazing and well written. The scares are tasteful and impactful. You will expect to be scared  and that anticipation will keep you scared. There is no monster or villain. No chasseing or fighting. Nothing to run from even. Just you with your thoughts and memories trying to make sense of it all. Don't go into it joking and laughing, go in with curiosity and awareness and you will not be disappointed by this decade old game.",
